abstract: "Py3plex is a Python library for analysis and visualization of multilayer (heterogeneous) networks. Complex networks are used as means for representing multimodal, real-life systems. With increasing amounts of data that lead to large multilayer networks consisting of different node and edge types, that can also be subject to temporal change, there is an increasing need for versatile visualization and analysis software."
